  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n(13, 5, 87)\n\n__**(13 - 5)**__ × 9 + __**(5 + 10)**__ = 87\n\n__**8 × 9**__ + 15 = 87\n\n__**72 + 15**__ = 87\n\n87 = 87 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(17, 6, 115)\n\n__(17 - 6)__ × 9 + __(6 + 10)__ = 115\n\n__11 × 9__ + 16 = 115\n\n__99 + 16__ = 115\n\n115 = 115 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (21, 7, 153) \n\n__(21 - 7)__ × 9 + __(7 + 10)__ = 153\n\n__14 × 9__ + 17 = 153\n\n__126 + 17__ = 153\n\n143 ≠ 153 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) (9, 4, 6) \n\n__(9 - 4)__ × 9 + __(4 + 10)__ = 6\n\n__5 × 9__ + 14 = 6\n\n__45 + 14__ = 6\n\n59 ≠ 6 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) (29, 9, 207) \n\n__(22 - 9)__ × 9 + __(9 + 10)__ = 207\n\n__13 × 9__ + 19 = 207\n\n__117 + 19__ = 207\n\n136 ≠ 207 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) (25, 8, 171)\n\n__(25 - 8)__ × 9 + __(8 + 10)__ = 171\n\n__17 × 9__ + 18 = 171\n\n__153 + 18__ = 171\n\n**171 = 171 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nThus, out of all '(25, 8, 171)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, **\"Option 4\"** is the correct answer.",
